<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT - Fraser downgrades STIC.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fraser downgrades STIC.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Securities on Thursday donngraded state-linked Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp, a diversified industrial conglomerate, to a &quot;long-term buy&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; on the basis of the group's high price earnings (p/e) ratio.</p>
<p>&quot;At its current price, the prospective 1996 financial year (ending December 31) p/e is around 32 times, and is towards the upper end of its historical p/e band of 23-40 times,&quot; Fraser said in a research note.</p>
</text>
